This product bundles the official JSON Schema for OpenAPI 3.1 documents
(data/openapi/oas-3.1-schema-2025-09-15.json), copied unchanged from
https://spec.openapis.org/oas/3.1/schema/2025-09-15. `urlcode openapi --check`
validates documents against it.

